    stage3_current_source_hir_rss_termination_2026_08_14, 0, "After the HIR contract-model diagnostic cleared, two current-source pure-Simple Stage 3 retries grew without a compiler diagnostic or candidate; the final bounded cycle was terminated by signal 15 after 12m52s at 24,839,624 KiB maximum RSS."
